盘边，侧拍。\n4. 客厅，女主挥动逗猫棒，橘猫跃起捕捉，动态。\n模板2：\n生成3*3的九宫格分镜图，电影风格。\n1. 晨光，卧室，棕发女主侧卧，橘色长毛猫蹭脸，温馨。\n2. 厨房，女主倒猫粮，橘猫抬头期待，特写。\n3. 书桌，女主专注电脑，橘猫趴在键盘边，侧拍。\n4. 客厅，女主挥动逗猫棒，橘猫跃起捕捉，动态。\n5. 阳台阳光，女主看书，橘猫在腿上打盹，静谧。\n6. 镜前，女主穿上牛仔外套，橘猫蹲在脚边，全身。\n7. 窗边黄昏，女主抱起橘猫看晚霞，剪影氛围。\n8. 沙发，女主吃零食，橘猫眼神渴望，近景。\n9. 卧室关灯，女主与橘猫相拥入眠，微光暖色。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 91, "type": "LayerUtility: TextBox", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: TextBox"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [26, 40, 86], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["gemini-3-flash-preview", "You are a helpful assistant", "Hello", 0.6, 1112808337, "randomize", 4096, 1, 0, 0, "none", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 23, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "